{"suttaId":"thag17.2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[3697,3808],"vripara":"981"},"segments":{"thag17.2:0.4":"Sāriputtattheragāthā","thag17.2:1.1":"“Yathācārī yathāsato satīmā, yatasaṅkappajjhāyi appamatto;","thag17.2:1.3":"Ajjhattarato samāhitatto, eko santusito tamāhu bhikkhuṃ.","thag17.2:2.1":"“Allaṃ sukkhaṃ vā bhuñjanto, na bāḷhaṃ suhito siyā;","thag17.2:2.3":"Ūnūdaro mitāhāro, sato bhikkhu paribbaje.","thag17.2:3.1":"“Cattāro pañca ālope, abhutvā udakaṃ pive;","thag17.2:3.3":"Alaṃ phāsuvihārāya, pahitattassa bhikkhuno.","thag17.2:4.1":"“Kappiyaṃ taṃ ce chādeti, cīvaraṃ idamatthikaṃ [idamatthitaṃ (sī.)];","thag17.2:4.3":"Alaṃ phāsuvihārāya, pahitattassa bhikkhuno.","thag17.2:5.1":"“Pallaṅkena nisinnassa, jaṇṇuke nābhivassati;","thag17.2:5.3":"Alaṃ phāsuvihārāya, pahitattassa bhikkhuno.","thag17.2:6.1":"[saṃ. ni.4.253; itivu.53]“Yo sukhaṃ dukkhato adda, dukkhamaddakkhi sallato;","thag17.2:6.3":"Ubhayantarena [ubhayamantare (sī.)] nāhosi, kena lokasmi kiṃ siyā.","thag17.2:7.1":"“Mā me kadāci pāpiccho, kusīto hīnavīriyo;","thag17.2:7.3":"Appassuto anādaro, kena lokasmi kiṃ siyā.","thag17.2:8.1":"“Bahussuto ca medhāvī, sīlesu susamāhito;","thag17.2:8.3":"Cetosamathamanuyutto, api muddhani tiṭṭhatu.","thag17.2:9.1":"“Yo papañcamanuyutto, papañcābhirato mago;","thag17.2:9.3":"Virādhayī so nibbānaṃ, yogakkhemaṃ anuttaraṃ.","thag17.2:10.1":"“Yo ca papañcaṃ hitvāna, nippapañcapathe rato;","thag17.2:10.3":"Ārādhayī so nibbānaṃ, yogakkhemaṃ anuttaraṃ.","thag17.2:11.1":"[dha. pa.98]“Gāme vā yadi vāraññe, ninne vā yadi vā thale;","thag17.2:11.3":"Yattha arahanto viharanti, taṃ bhūmirāmaṇeyyakaṃ.","thag17.2:12.1":"“Ramaṇīyāni araññāni, yattha na ramatī jano;","thag17.2:12.3":"Vītarāgā ramissanti, na te kāmagavesino.","thag17.2:13.1":"[dha. pa.76]“Nidhīnaṃva pavattāraṃ, yaṃ passe vajjadassinaṃ;","thag17.2:13.3":"Niggayhavādiṃ medhāviṃ, tādisaṃ paṇḍitaṃ bhaje;","thag17.2:13.5":"Tādisaṃ bhajamānassa, seyyo hoti na pāpiyo.","thag17.2:14.1":"[dha. pa.77]“Ovadeyyānusāseyya, asabbhā ca nivāraye;","thag17.2:14.3":"Satañhi so piyo hoti, asataṃ hoti appiyo.","thag17.2:15.1":"“Aññassa bhagavā buddho, dhammaṃ desesi cakkhumā;","thag17.2:15.3":"Dhamme desiyamānamhi, sotamodhesimatthiko;","thag17.2:16.1":"Taṃ me amoghaṃ savanaṃ, vimuttomhi anāsavo.","thag17.2:17.1":"“Neva pubbenivāsāya, napi dibbassa cakkhuno;","thag17.2:17.3":"Cetopariyāya iddhiyā, cutiyā upapattiyā;","thag17.2:17.5":"Sotadhātuvisuddhiyā, paṇidhī me na vijjati [kathā.378].","thag17.2:18.1":"“Rukkhamūlaṃva nissāya, muṇḍo saṅghāṭipāruto;","thag17.2:18.3":"Paññāya uttamo thero, upatissova [upatisso ca (sī. ka.)] jhāyati.","thag17.2:19.1":"“Avitakkaṃ samāpanno, sammāsambuddhasāvako;","thag17.2:19.3":"Ariyena tuṇhībhāvena, upeto hoti tāvade.","thag17.2:20.1":"[udā.24]“Yathāpi pabbato selo, acalo suppatiṭṭhito;","thag17.2:20.3":"Evaṃ mohakkhayā bhikkhu, pabbatova na vedhati.","thag17.2:21.1":"“Anaṅgaṇassa posassa, niccaṃ sucigavesino;","thag17.2:21.3":"Vālaggamattaṃ pāpassa, abbhamattaṃva khāyati.","thag17.2:22.1":"“Nābhinandāmi maraṇaṃ, nābhinandāmi jīvitaṃ;","thag17.2:22.3":"Nikkhipissaṃ imaṃ kāyaṃ, sampajāno patissato.","thag17.2:23.1":"“Nābhinandāmi maraṇaṃ, nābhinandāmi jīvitaṃ;","thag17.2:23.3":"Kālañca paṭikaṅkhāmi, nibbisaṃ bhatako yathā.","thag17.2:24.1":"“Ubhayena midaṃ maraṇameva, nāmaraṇaṃ pacchā vā pure vā;","thag17.2:24.3":"Paṭipajjatha mā vinassatha, khaṇo vo mā upaccagā.","thag17.2:25.1":"“Nagaraṃ yathā paccantaṃ, guttaṃ santarabāhiraṃ;","thag17.2:25.3":"Evaṃ gopetha attānaṃ, khaṇo vo mā upaccagā;","thag17.2:25.5":"Khaṇātītā hi socanti, nirayamhi samappitā.","thag17.2:26.1":"“Upasanto uparato, mantabhāṇī [mattabhāṇī (sī.)] anuddhato;","thag17.2:26.3":"Dhunāti pāpake dhamme, dumapattaṃva māluto.","thag17.2:27.1":"“Upasanto uparato, mantabhāṇī anuddhato;","thag17.2:27.3":"Appāsi [abbahi (syā.), abhāsi (?)] pāpake dhamme, dumapattaṃva māluto.","thag17.2:28.1":"“Upasanto anāyāso, vippasanno anāvilo;","thag17.2:28.3":"Kalyāṇasīlo medhāvī, dukkhassantakaro siyā.","thag17.2:29.1":"“Na vissase ekatiyesu evaṃ, agārisu pabbajitesu cāpi;","thag17.2:29.3":"Sādhūpi hutvā na asādhu honti, asādhu hutvā puna sādhu honti.","thag17.2:30.1":"“Kāmacchando ca byāpādo, thinamiddhañca bhikkhuno;","thag17.2:30.3":"Uddhaccaṃ vicikicchā ca, pañcete cittakelisā.","thag17.2:31.1":"“Yassa sakkariyamānassa, asakkārena cūbhayaṃ;","thag17.2:31.3":"Samādhi na vikampati, appamādavihārino.","thag17.2:32.1":"“Taṃ jhāyinaṃ sātatikaṃ, sukhumadiṭṭhivipassakaṃ;","thag17.2:32.3":"Upādānakkhayārāmaṃ, āhu sappuriso iti.","thag17.2:33.1":"“Mahāsamuddo pathavī, pabbato anilopi ca;","thag17.2:33.3":"Upamāya na yujjanti, satthu varavimuttiyā.","thag17.2:34.1":"“Cakkānuvattako thero, mahāñāṇī samāhito;","thag17.2:34.3":"Pathavāpaggisamāno, na rajjati na dussati.","thag17.2:35.1":"“Paññāpāramitaṃ patto, mahābuddhi mahāmati;","thag17.2:35.3":"Ajaḷo jaḷasamāno, sadā carati nibbuto.","thag17.2:36.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā … pe … bhavanetti samūhatā.","thag17.2:37.1":"“Sampādethappamādena, esā me anusāsanī;","thag17.2:37.3":"Handāhaṃ parinibbissaṃ, vippamuttomhi sabbadhī”ti.","thag17.2:37.5":"… Sāriputto thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
